This repository adds an independently implemented native Rust revision authority,
lossless package adapters, TypeScript authoring interface, native graph contract,
tests, build scripts and documentation. It does not bundle the TEITOK runtime.
Changes and corresponding build instructions are in CHANGELOG.md and README.md.

LaBB-CAT capability references informed layer/time/provenance validation design.
No LaBB-CAT AGPL source has been copied or linked into this implementation.

